  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Microsoft grew to more than fourteen times its starting value, while Intel grew to more than seven times. Both far outpaced the US share basket in this window. Disney also more than doubled. These striking gains do not make every technology stock a sure winner. The prices still moved unevenly, and the result depends on this particular five-year window.",
