      "yahoo-dis",
      "south-africa-vote",
      "windows95",
      "pathfinder"
    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "The Fed was beginning to raise short-term rates, entertainment companies were combining, and computer makers were selling new products.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "The chosen technology shares gained much more than the broad basket. Holding a basket traded away some of that winning-company exposure in exchange for relying on many businesses.",
    "what_faded_away": "A small initial interest-rate increase did not tell you the final ranking. An Olympic victory and a takeover contest were interesting news, but not a map of future returns.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Nobody knew these exact gains in advance. Today’s familiarity with Microsoft and Intel can make their earlier risks easier to overlook.",
